    {
      "name": "Caustic Aura",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [
        "alchemical",
        "aura",
        "olfactory"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "90 feet. The chromatic ooze emanates noxious chemicals into the environment. A creature that enters the aura or starts its turn within it is sickened 1 unless it succeeds at a DC 37 Fortitude save. Creatures with the scent ability or a particularly heightened sense of smell are sickened 2, or sickened 1 on a successful Fortitude save. Creatures in the aura can't recover from the sickened condition."
      ],
      "save": {
        "defense": "fortitude",
        "dc": 37,
        "basic": false,
        "outcomes": {}
      },
      "aura": {
        "range": 90,
        "unit": "ft"
      }
    },
